stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Selected: stable page ID
    Selected --> FadingOut: navigation changes ID and invalidates pending request
    FadingOut --> Incubating: look up metadata and component in PageRegistry
    Selected --> Incubating: initial load
    Incubating --> Attached: Ready and request is current
    Incubating --> Discarded: Ready but selection changed or container closing
    Incubating --> Failed: Component.Error
    Attached --> FadingOut: another page selected
    Discarded --> [*]: destroy stale object
    Failed --> Selected: select another page
    note right of Incubating
        Components stay hidden until attached.
        Each load has a generation token.
        Navigation order is not page identity.
    end note
